=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Kaede} in {z:Port Bastok} at (J-5) - nearest to **Home Point #1 (E)** - in the north most house for a cutscene.
** (if she says "I heard somebody at the warehouse saying that the people from Aht Urhgan are sneaky.", disregard it and talk to her again.)
* Talk to {p:Kagetora} at (F-6), inside the door to **Warehouse 2**.
* Return to Kaede's house and speak with {n:Ensetsu} at (I-5) for a cutscene.
** The quest log entry will appear after this cutscene.
* Travel to (K-8) within {z:Korroloka Tunnel}, Map 5.
** The quickest entrance is from {z:Western Altepa Desert} at (M-8), via the {p:Survival Guide}. This entrance will bring you directly to Map 5.
** Although the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Zeruhn Mines} is also close.

!Korroloka Tunnel-map1.jpg||Korroloka (Map 1)
!Korroloka Tunnel-map2.jpg||Korroloka (Map 2)
!Korroloka Tunnel-map5.jpg||Korroloka (Map 5)
* Click on the **???** to spawn 3 {m:Korroloka Leeches|Korroloka Leech}.
** These leeches will link with any {m:Thread Leeches|Thread Leech} in the vicinity.
** If for some reason you click on the **???** and the Leeches don't pop, try relogging.
* Once the leeches are defeated and after the bodies despawn, click on the **???** to receive the {@k} {k:Strangely shaped coral}.
** Multiple players may do this quest at the same time for the coral:
*** Have one member spawn it. After the Leeches are defeated and despawn, have the other players select the **???** for the coral before the spawning player.
*** **{c=red:Note:}** If the person who spawned the leeches is KO'd, do not raise them until after the Korroloka Leeches have been defeated. Otherwise, they will respawn immediately.
* Return to {n:Ensetsu} in {z:Port Bastok} at (I-5).
* Travel to {z:Norg} and speak with {n:Ryoma} at (H-8), who will give you the {@k} {k:Sealed dagger}.
* Return to {n:Ensetsu} to complete the quest.
** **(Optional)** Speak to Kaede afterwards for some closing dialogue.

